/// Optimization & Production Module
///
/// Performance optimizations and production acceleration for diffusion models.
///
/// ## Components
///
/// - **config**: DiffusionOptimizationConfig and presets
/// - **attention**: Flash attention and memory-efficient attention
/// - **memory**: Tiling, offloading, and slicing strategies
/// - **quantization**: FP8, INT8, and mixed-precision quantization
/// - **cache**: Prompt embedding and latent caching
/// - **distilled**: LCM, Turbo, Lightning distilled models
/// - **compile**: AOT compilation and kernel fusion
///
/// ## Performance Tiers
///
/// - **Fast**: Default optimizations for good speed/quality balance
/// - **Memory**: Minimize VRAM usage at cost of speed
/// - **Quality**: Maximum quality, no shortcuts
/// - **Realtime**: Ultra-fast inference for interactive use

pub mod config
pub mod attention
pub mod memory
pub mod quantization
pub mod cache
pub mod distilled
pub mod compile

